            mod.widgets.HagencyHint{text:A.t("Select earlier or later nodes. After renaming or removing a node, update any condition that refers to its ID. Invalid dependencies are checked before saving.","可选择之前或之后的节点。重命名或移除节点后，请更新引用该 ID 的条件。保存前会检查无效依赖。")}
